1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
The Great Wall is 21,196 km long.
I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:05,000
Over 13,000 miles — about half the equator.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,400
It took more than 2,000 years and many dynasties.

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,700
But here's the myth everyone repeats:

5
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:12,200
You cannot see it from space with your eyes.

6
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,600
Apollo to the ISS — astronauts all confirm it.

7
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,800
Double-tap if this surprised you.

8
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:20,000
★ Expert Tip: Walk Mutianyu or Jinshanling — far fewer crowds than Badaling.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,600
Did you believe the space myth? Comment below.
